<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 380.89 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS TUES.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 380.89 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS TUES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 380.89 million rands worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after buying 269.30 million on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
